UID:bm-5469320260610@shop.queenbooks.ca
DESCRIPTION:[In Store]\nJoin us for the launch of\nMy Mother Joins the Res
 istance\nby Richard Harrison! Meet the author\, mingle\, and get your book
  signed.\nRichard Harrison\nis the winner of the 2017 Governor General’s
  Award for Poetry for\nOn Not Losing My Father’s Ashes in the Flood.\nRi
 chard’s writings have been published across Canada as well as in the Uni
 ted States\, England and Italy. His individual poems\, and two books\, hav
 e been translated into six languages including Spanish\, Farsi\, French an
 d Arabic. This year he was honoured with the Writers’ Guild of Alberta
 ’s Golden Pen for Lifetime Achievement. Professor Emeritus of English at
  Mount Royal University\, currently Richard is a full-time poet\, essayist
 \, editor and writing mentor in Calgary\, where he lives with his wife\, L
 isa.
LOCATION:914 Queen Street East
URL:https://shop.queenbooks.ca/events
X-SOURCE:Queen Books
END:VEVENT
